                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">District and
                            Port of <placeName>New York</placeName></hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Collector’s Office.</hi></dateline></opener>
                <p>I hereby certify the within to be true copy of the original on record in this
                    office.</p>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left">Given under my hand and seal <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1873-11-20">this 20th day of November,
                            1873</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/> [Seal of the collector of the port of New York.] <lb/>
                    <signed>A. PUFFER,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">D.
                    Collector.</hi></signed></closer>




